#! rate=48000 block=64 tracks=2
# External clock joined mid-song (no FA): follow starts at Move's next bar
# (ext_base, 96 F8s on) with a restart of our transport, then the clock
# stops without FC and goes stale after 0.5 s (24,000 frames, a whole
# number of 64-frame blocks, so the frame-by-frame and whole-block runs
# agree on where the internal clock resumes). F8 every 960 frames.
# D1 trace: each tick at the frame where Movy, fed one frame at a time, fires it
@0 tog 0 0 60 100
@0 tog 0 3 62 90
@0 tog 0 8 67 100
@0 tog 0 14 64 80
@0 tog 1 0 36 100
@0 tog 1 4 38 100
@0 tog 1 8 36 100
@0 tog 1 12 38 100
@0 alabel 0 0 synth:cutoff
@0 abaseq 0 0 40
@0 aset 0 0 4 90 1
@0 aset 0 0 12 10 1
@0 play
@12800 rt F8
